    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120-a1">

                <pb facs="0244" n="152" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg152"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The viceroy of Fukien telegraphs that United States consul at Amoy has protested
                    against granting settlement to Japan unless one is granted the United States. Is
                    this your desire?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
